- `c10/cuda/CUDAStream.h` - CUDA stream management
- `c10/cuda/CUDAGuard.h` - CUDA device guards
- `ATen/cuda/CUDAContext.h` - CUDA context management
- `ATen/cudnn/Descriptors.h` - cuDNN tensor descriptors

