# DataLoader

The DataLoader batches samples from a dataset and optionally shuffles and
parallelizes the loading process. It is the main interface for iterating
over training data.

## DataLoader Classes

```{doxygenclass} torch::data::DataLoaderBase
:members:
:undoc-members:
```

## DataLoaderOptions

